01:07:55.610 --> 01:08:03.930
This entire third act was written in a breakout pod of writers of Mindy, BJ, Gene, and Lee in about 12 hours.
这整个第三幕是由明迪、B.J.、吉恩和李组成的编剧小组在大约12个小时内赶出来的。

