01:19:03.990 --> 01:19:05.510
Sorry, all you podcast listeners.
抱歉啦，各位播客听众。

1846
01:19:05.510 --> 01:19:10.670
I had an audition one time for a national campaign for bananas.
我曾经去为香蕉的一个全国性广告活动试镜。

1847
01:19:11.150 --> 01:19:11.910
