Can you lower your register?
你能把音调放低一点吗？

1854
01:19:29.510 --> 01:19:32.890
And I said, oh, okay.
我说，哦，好的。

1855
01:19:33.510 --> 01:19:37.470
So I have to take a bite of the banana and then say the line.
所以我得咬一口香蕉，然后再说台词。

1856
01:19:38.470 --> 01:19:41.090
Whatever the line is, these bananas are great.
不管台词是什么，这些香蕉真棒。

1857
01:19:41.270 --> 01:19:42.750
Whatever it was, I can't remember.
不管当时台词是什么，我记不清了。

1858
01:19:42.990 --> 01:19:47.290
